Third-party material referenced by this release

Pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic structure
    The four-state mammillary transport with an effect compartment, and the sigmoid depth surface,
    follow the published propofol and remifentanil models cited by the manuscript:
      - Eleveld, Colin, Absalom and Struys, British Journal of Anaesthesia 120(5), 2018
      - Minto et al., Anesthesiology 86(1), 1997
      - Schnider et al., Anesthesiology 88(5), 1998 (comparison arm only)
    The typical-value parameter sets are arithmetic constants of those models. The covariate
    exponents used here are allometric defaults, not values reprinted from those papers, and are
    marked as such in src/respire/sim/pharmacokinetics.py.

